---
description:
  Smoke test covering all 14 classic flowchart shapes in a single diagram,
  rendered under the default layout. Chained one-to-the-next rather than
  combined pairwise, so this stays a per-shape smoke test rather than a
  combinatorial one.
coveredShapes:
  - rectangle
  - rounded
  - stadium
  - subroutine
  - cylinder
  - circle
  - asymmetric
  - rhombus
  - hexagon
  - parallelogram
  - parallelogram-alt
  - trapezoid
  - trapezoid-alt
  - double-circle
---
flowchart TD
    A[Rectangle] --> B(Rounded)
    B --> C([Stadium])
    C --> D[[Subroutine]]
    D --> E[(Database)]
    E --> F((Circle))
    F --> G>Asymmetric]
    G --> H{Decision}
    H --> I{{Hexagon}}
    I --> J[/Parallelogram/]
    J --> K[\Parallelogram alt\]
    K --> L[/Trapezoid\]
    L --> M[\Trapezoid alt/]
    M --> N(((Double circle)))
